      "content": "Actually, looking at that, the 25% spike in Engineering is going to be a huge red flag for the Board. I'm really worried it'll undermine the message of stability we're trying to send. \n\nCan we rephrase that part? Instead of calling it a \"notable exception,\" can we just frame the turnover trends more broadly? I want to focus on the overall continuity of the workforce so we don't get bogged down in departmental outliers during the presentation.",
